# Original resetius/lsystem Fractint-rule catalog (commit f7fa950):
# RESETIUS | Hex {
# RESETIUS |   Angle 6	  ; Turns are 60=360/6 degrees
# RESETIUS |   Axiom f	  ; Birth string is f
# RESETIUS |   f=-f+f+g[+f+f]- ; Replacement string for f
# RESETIUS |   g=gg		  ; Replacement string for g (see text below)
# RESETIUS |   }
